Why Is the Intelligent Pigging Market Growing?
Expanding Hydrogen Transportation Infrastructure
Governments and energy companies are investing in hydrogen production, transportation, and distribution infrastructure.
Hydrogen pipelines require specialized integrity monitoring because hydrogen exposure can contribute to material degradation under certain operating conditions.
Increasing Investment in Carbon Capture Infrastructure
Carbon capture, utilization, and storage projects require reliable CO2 transportation networks.
Intelligent inspection systems help operators monitor pipeline integrity and identify potential defects.
Strengthening Pipeline Safety Regulations
Pipeline operators must maintain appropriate inspection and maintenance programs to address safety and environmental risks.
Growing Demand for Predictive Maintenance
Advanced inspection technologies enable operators to evaluate pipeline conditions and prioritize maintenance activities based on identified risks.
